---
description: Maverick context-to-PR workflow
alwaysApply: false
---
When working on a Maverick task, read `.maverick/tasks/<task>/PRD.md` and `TECHSPEC.md` first, then the current `subtasks/task_NN.md`. Treat PRD.md (what) and TECHSPEC.md (how) as authoritative scope. Prefer minimal diffs, preserve existing contracts, run explicit verification, and stop for material ambiguity.
